lock3d.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Performance awards </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS ROG RTX 5090 Astral LC Review\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>02/17/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Astral LC GeForce RTX™ 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Media review Award of Performance awards \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://overclock3d.net/reviews/gpu_displays/asus-rog-rtx-5090-astral-lc-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1332/202506251040381340191.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8.5 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HardwareZone.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8.5 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Yet, credit where it's due: ROG has genuinely delivered with its new Astral range of graphics cards, especially this RTX 5090 variant. Price and power draw aside, the card's outstanding performance and impressive thermal efficiency place it firmly at the forefront of this generation's RTX 5090 lineup.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>04/30/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Astral LC GeForce RTX™ 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Media review Award of 8.5 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarezone.com.sg/review-nvidia-rog-astral-geforce-rtx-5090\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202507141052094320060.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Red Dot Design Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Red Dot\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Red Dot Design Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With its versatility, the ROG Astral LC GeForce RTX 50 GPU Series is ideally suited to both creative and technical working environments.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>07/14/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Astral LC GeForce RTX™ 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Media review Award of Red Dot Design Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.red-dot.org/zh/project/rog-astral-lc-geforce-rtx-50-series-78423\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/201911081918512270060.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Cowcotland\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS card enhances the technological showcase imagined by NVIDIA, the manufacturer unleashes all its expertise on this unique component, the design approaches perfection and the cooling system is perfect, combining low temperatures and unprecedented discretion!\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>05/14/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Astral LC GeForce RTX™ 5090 32GB GDDR7 OC Edition Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.cowcotland.com/articles/4595-8/test-rog-astral-lc-geforce-rtx-5090-32gb-gddr7-oc-edition-le-gb202-sublime-par-asus.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__reward